<view class="page theme-{{themeId}} {{themeId !== 'forest' ? 'theme-designed' : ''}}" style="{{themeStyle}};{{themeAssetStyle}}">
  <view class="title">环境反馈与模拟上报</view><view class="notice">仅进入本平台管理员工作队列，未发送政府部门或外部机构。提交后，仅本人和授权管理员可查看。识别结果不是污染或水质鉴定。</view>
  <button wx:if="{{!loggedIn}}" class="activity-button primary section" bindtap="login">登录后查看与提交</button>
  <page-state loading="{{loading}}" error="{{error}}" bindretry="load" />
  <view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="notice section">{{notice}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{loggedIn && context}}" class="card section report-form"><view class="title">本次照片观察</view><view class="copy">该地河道情况如何？是否选择上报有关部门？</view><view class="copy">请填写亲眼观察到的环境情况。此表单只提交本平台管理员模拟核对，未向政府或有关部门发送；如需自行联系有关部门，可复制下方官网链接后在浏览器打开。</view><image wx:if="{{photo}}" class="report-photo" src="{{photo}}" mode="aspectFit" /><view class="copy">{{context.observation}}</view><view class="small muted gap">共享原识别缩略图引用，不复制或延长图片保存期限。图片到期或原记录删除后，管理员也无法查看。</view>
    <block wx:if="{{!context.existing_report}}"><picker range="{{choices}}" range-key="name" value="{{locationIndex}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindchange="location"><view class="report-picker">观察地点：{{choices[locationIndex].name}} ⌄</view></picker><input wx:if="{{!locationIndex}}" value="{{locationText}}" data-field="locationText" bindinput="field" maxlength="120" placeholder="填写地点、河段或附近地标" disabled="{{busy}}" /><textarea value="{{description}}" data-field="description" bindinput="field" maxlength="1000" placeholder="请描述照片中实际可见的问题，例如岸边散落包装物；不要填写他人隐私。" disabled="{{busy}}" /><button class="activity-button primary gap" bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || loading}}">提交模拟环境上报</button></block>
    <view wx:else class="notice gap">这张识别照片已提交模拟上报，可在下方查看状态与答复。</view>
  </view>
  <button wx:if="{{loggedIn && !context && !loading}}" class="activity-button secondary section" bindtap="identify">先完成花卉或河道照片识别</button>
  <view class="card section"><view class="title">有关部门官方网站</view><view class="copy">复制官网链接，在浏览器中打开。此操作不会发送照片或反馈，也不代表有关部门已受理。</view><view wx:for="{{officialSites}}" wx:key="id" class="official-site"><view class="copy">{{item.label}}</view><text class="official-site-url small" selectable="{{true}}">{{item.url}}</text><button class="activity-button secondary gap" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="copyOfficialSite">复制网站链接</button></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loggedIn}}" class="section"><view class="section-title">我的环境反馈</view><view wx:if="{{!records.length && !loading}}" class="copy">暂无环境反馈。</view><view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id" class="card section"><text class="pill">{{item.status_label}}</text><view class="title gap">{{item.location.name}}</view><view class="small muted gap">{{item.location.user_supplied ? '用户填写，未核实位置' : '用户选择的目录地点，未核验拍摄位置'}}</view><view class="copy">{{item.description}}</view><view class="small muted gap">{{item.observation}}</view><view class="small muted gap">{{item.created_label}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.reply}}" class="notice gap">管理员答复：{{item.reply}}</view><view class="report-actions"><button class="activity-button secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="photo" disabled="{{busy}}">查看照片引用</button><button class="activity-button activity-text-button text-button" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove" disabled="{{busy}}">删除反馈</button></view></view><button wx:if="{{next}}" class="activity-button secondary" bindtap="more" disabled="{{busy || loading}}">加载更多</button></view>
</view>
